  translation {
    text: "Affected northbound trips:\r\n4:54 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n5:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n7:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n9:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n11:39 pm from Florida Station to 18th & California Station\r\n\nAffected southbound trips:\r\n6:30 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n8:30 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n10:30 pm from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station\r\n12:30 am from 18th & Stout Station to Florida Station"
